{"code":"BL17","wikidata":"Q4920172","wikipedia":{"en":"Khlong Toei MRT station","th":"สถานีคลองเตย"},"summary":{"en":"Khlong Toei MRT station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Blue Line. Located under Rama IV Road, near Metropolitan Electricity Authority Headquarters and Chaloem Maha Nakhon Expressway in Khlong Toei District, Bangkok, Thailand. Construction of the MRT began at this station nine months after the foundation stone was laid by King Maha Vajiralongkorn (while he was the crown prince) on November 19, 1996 at Hua Lamphong station.","th":"สถานีคลองเตย เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนพระรามที่ 4 กรุงเทพมหานคร บริเวณทางขึ้น-ลงทางพิเศษเฉลิมมหานคร ใกล้ซอยโรงงานยาสูบ"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg/960px-Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/201701_Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Platform_1_of_Khlong_Toei_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Khlong_Toei_Station_-_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg/960px-Khlong_Toei_Station_-_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khlong_Toei_Station_-_concourse_level_(1).jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Khlong_Toei_Station_-_concourse_level_%282